1
00:00:00,414 --> 00:00:01,994
(Scene:)Sheldon.

2
00:00:08,088 --> 00:00:11,218
(Scene:)- Sheldon.
- Danger. Danger.

3
00:00:11,592 --> 00:00:12,882
No danger, it's me, Penny.

4
00:00:13,052 --> 00:00:16,222
Listen, I got to level 25
and reached Purple Lotus Swamp, right?

5
00:00:16,388 --> 00:00:18,058
- You're in my bedroom.
- Yeah.

6
00:00:18,724 --> 00:00:22,264
(Penny:)- Leonard gave me an emergency key.
- People can't be in my bedroom.

7
00:00:22,436 --> 00:00:25,686
(Penny:)- Can we go talk in the living room?
- I'm not wearing pajama bottoms.

8
00:00:27,316 --> 00:00:29,856
(Man:)- Why not?
- I spilled grape juice.

9
00:00:30,277 --> 00:00:31,697
Well, wear different pajamas.

10
00:00:31,862 --> 00:00:34,742
Can't wear different pajamas.
These are my Monday pajamas.

11
00:00:35,699 --> 00:00:37,659
(Sheldon:)Penny, people cannot be in my bedroom.

12
00:00:38,035 --> 00:00:41,125
(Penny:)Just tell me, is it too soon
to join a quest to the Black Castle?

13
00:00:41,664 --> 00:00:44,334
(Sheldon:)You were invited on a quest
to the Black Castle?

14
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,550
(Penny:)By some guys in Budapest. I'm just not
sure it's the right move for my character.

15
00:00:48,921 --> 00:00:51,671
(Sheldon:)Of course it's not. You're only a level 25.

16
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:55,340
These Hungarians are just using you
for dragon fodder.

17
00:00:55,970 --> 00:01:01,020
(Penny:)Really? Boy, you'd think you could trust
a horde of Hungarian Barbarians.

